  "releaseNotes": "Fix: if a turn failed (e.g. a 529 from the provider) while a message was already sitting in the injection queue, Operative left its turn slot permanently stuck on the dead, faulted turn -- every later submission just rejoined it and replayed the same fault instantly, with no new attempt ever made, until the process was restarted. The turn slot is now always released once a fault ends the turn, regardless of what was pending.",
